msgid "解码器是编码器的\"镜像\"——把缩小的特征图一步步放大回原始分辨率。核心操作有两个："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/u-net.md:78
msgid "1. 上采样（Upsampling）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/u-net.md:80
msgid "U-Net 使用**转置卷积（Transposed Convolution）** 进行上采样。直觉上，它和卷积做的事相反："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/u-net.md:83
msgid "转置卷积：2×2 → 4×4"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/u-net.md:137
msgid "转置卷积的直觉"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/u-net.md:140
msgid "普通卷积：3×3 窗口滑过输入 → 输出更小 转置卷积：每个输入点\"膨胀\"成 2×2 区域 → 输出更大"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/u-net.md:144
msgid "转置卷积通过在每个输入元素之间插入零值，然后做标准卷积来实现尺寸加倍。它的参数也是**可学习的**，不像双线性插值是固定的。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/u-net.md:147
msgid "2. 跳跃连接（Skip Connection）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/u-net.md:149
msgid "这是 U-Net 的灵魂。上采样后的特征图与**编码器对应层的特征图在通道维度上拼接**（concatenate）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/u-net.md:151
msgid ""
"F_{\\text{concat}} = \\text{concat}(F_{\\text{encoder}}, "
"F_{\\text{decoder}}) \\in \\mathbb{R}^{H \\times W \\times "
"(C_{\\text{enc}} + C_{\\text{dec}})}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/u-net.md:155
msgid "**为什么拼接而不是相加？**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/u-net.md:157
msgid "FCN 用相加，U-Net 用拼接。拼接**保留了编码器特征的全部信息**（不压缩），让解码器可以\"看到\"原始细节。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/u-net.md:159
msgid "跳跃连接的三个作用"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/u-net.md:162
msgid "**保留空间信息**：编码器浅层知道\"边缘在第 35 行\"，解码器需要这个信息"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/u-net.md:163
msgid "**改善梯度流动**：梯度可以\"抄近道\"直接传到浅层，缓解梯度消失"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/u-net.md:164
msgid "**多尺度特征融合**：不同感受野的特征同时被利用"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/u-net.md:167
msgid "跳跃连接的梯度分析"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/u-net.md:169
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"跳跃连接对训练的最大贡献是**解决了梯度消失问题**。{ref}`gradient-vanishing` "
"中我们详细讨论过梯度消失的成因——反向传播时梯度经过多层连乘会指数级衰减，导致浅层无法学习。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/u-net.md:171
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"要理解跳跃连接为什么能缓解这个问题，需要先理解 {ref}`jacobian-matrix` 的概念（详见 {doc}`../math-"
"fundamentals/back-propagation`）。核心洞察是：深层网络的梯度计算等于**多层 Jacobian 矩阵的连乘**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/u-net.md:173
msgid "没有跳跃连接时：Jacobian 连乘"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/u-net.md:175
msgid "链式法则告诉我们，损失 $L$ 对第 $l$ 层权重 $W_l$ 的梯度相当于**每一层 Jacobian 的连乘**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/u-net.md:177
msgid ""
"\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial W_l} = \\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial "
"\\hat{y}} \\cdot\n"
"\\underbrace{\\frac{\\partial h_{L}}{\\partial h_{L-1}} \\cdot\n"
"\\frac{\\partial h_{L-1}}{\\partial h_{L-2}} \\cdot \\dots \\cdot\n"
"\\frac{\\partial h_{l+1}}{\\partial h_{l}}}_{L-l \\text{ 个 Jacobian 相乘}}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/u-net.md:184
msgid ""
"每乘一个 Jacobian 都可能缩小或放大梯度。如果每层的\"放大倍数\"都小于 1，$L-l$ 个 Jacobian "
"连乘后梯度就会指数级衰减——梯度消失。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/u-net.md:186
msgid "有了跳跃连接：梯度抄近道"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/u-net.md:188
msgid "跳跃连接在反向传播中创建了一条**直达路径**，绕过了中间的深度："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/u-net.md:190
msgid ""
"\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial W_l} = \\underbrace{\\text{主路径（$L-l$ 个 "
"Jacobian 连乘）}}_{\\text{可能消失}} + \\underbrace{\\text{跳跃路径（仅 1-2 个 "
"Jacobian）}}_{\\text{几乎不衰减}}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/u-net.md:194
msgid ""
"第二条路径的 Jacobian 链极短——编码器第 2 层的梯度可以通过跳跃连接直接传到解码器第 2 层，中间只经过 1-2 "
"个变换，而不是从底部绕上来的 8-10 个。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/u-net.md:196
msgid "数值对比：64 倍的差距"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/u-net.md:199
msgid "假设每层 Jacobian 的放大倍数 = 0.8："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/u-net.md:201
#, python-brace-format
msgid "原始路径（穿过 20 层）：$0.8^{20} \\approx 0.01$（衰减了 99%）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/u-net.md:203
#, python-brace-format
msgid "跳跃路径（只穿过 2 层）：$0.8^{2} \\approx 0.64$（只衰减了 36%）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/u-net.md:205
msgid "差距：$0.01$ vs $0.64$，整整 **64 倍**。有了跳跃连接，浅层收到的梯度信号强了几十倍。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/u-net.md:208
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"这就是跳跃连接被称为\"梯度高速公路\"的原因——它为梯度提供了**绕过深度、直达浅层**的捷径。这个思路与 ResNet "
"{cite}`he2016deep` 的残差连接一脉相承：都是通过短路连接为梯度创造高速公路。{doc}`../cnn-expedition"
"/ablation-study/experiment-design` 中的消融实验也可以验证：去掉跳跃连接后，深层网络的浅层几乎学不到东西。"
msgstr ""

